In this folder we store our downloaded copies of the OS-Prey database.

All metadata and details for this database are stored in the original repository:
https://knb.ecoinformatics.org/view/doi%3A10.5063%2FF15719JP

Note that this database continues to be updated.

We also store two files processed from the OS-Prey database: 
BarnOwlDiet_20

BarnOwlMeta_20
Extracted from the OS-Prey meta file, we have added:
ecozone - a code from the 
ShannEnt_rare - Shannon entropy rarefied to 20 samples
DietRichness_rare - rarefied to 20 samples count of prey types in diet
Local_Richness - count of mammals occurring at the diet location
RE_Richness - count of just rodents and euliptyphla occurring at the diet location
Raptor_richness - count of raptor species occurring at the diet location

Finally, we store a file that is made from the analysis script for running linear models: BarnOwlProcessed_20.csv, where the 20 is the rarefaction size
